    "q": "What are the JD ad slot image ratios?",
    "a": "Published creative sizes split by age rather than by disagreement. Five undated seller pages give 350 by 350 pixels at 50KB in JPG, while two pages dated 2026 give 800 by 800 with an 800 by 1200 long form. Treat the older size as superseded and confirm the current one in the JD ad backend."
  },
  {
    "q": "Can I reuse Tmall images on JD?",
    "a": "Largely. Main images meeting the 800 by 800 and 1:1 figures carry across. Move the white-background image from the fifth slot to the first, reuse the detail page at 790 pixels desktop, and check every image against each platform's list of banned on-image elements, which is what actually forces rework."
