    "q": "Which assets have to be reshot for JD?",
    "a": "On the published evidence, very few for reasons of size. Ad creatives built to the old 350 by 350 figure need rebuilding, and images carrying elements one platform bans need rework. Everything else between these two platforms is a re-sequence or a re-crop rather than new capture."
